      "name": "datacircle",
      "description": "Every plan of every GTM API on datacircle.dev, as one file you download and query. The file covers People, Contact, Companies, Signals, Social media, E-commerce, Real estate and Web. For each plan, the file lists the price per 1,000 results, our score for the plan and the rate limits. The file also lists the fields the plan returns and a link to the plan's docs. Use the file to compare or price a GTM API.",
